| info = *Whispers from the Void infuse Xaku with untold power, expending {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''25''' [[energy]] to empower all equipped [[Weapons]] to inflict <u>'''1'''</u> [[Extra Hit]] per damage instance for {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''17% / 23% / 23% / 26%''' of total weapon damage as {{D|Void}} damage. Xata's Whisper lasts for {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''20 / 30 / 30 / 35''' seconds.
**[[Casting Speed]] is affected by {{M|Natural Talent}} and {{M|Speed Drift}}.
**The extra {{D|Void}} damage hit can remove [[Sentient]] and [[Shadow Stalker]]'s damage adaptation resistances upon triggering a [[Status Effect]].
**Extra hit per damage instance does not provide extra [[Melee Combo]] or [[Sniper Rifle]] combo gain.
**Xata's Whisper duration appears on the ability icon, as well as beside Xaku's shield and health indicators as a buff icon with the damage bonus and timer.
**The color of the visual effect on the warframe's body is determined by the warframe's primary/left energy color.
*Xata's Whisper {{D|Void}} damage is based on a percentage of the total weapon damage. 
**Damage bonus is a separate damage instance, and does '''not''' dilute weapon elements.
**Affected by base, elemental, critical, and faction damage mods (e.g. {{M|Serration}}, {{M|Hornet Strike}}, {{M|Pressure Point}}, {{M|Convulsion}}, {{M|Cleanse Grineer}}, {{M|Vital Sense}}, etc)
**The ability double dips on faction damage, and [[Enemy Body Parts|body part weaknesses]].
**Xata's Whisper can proc the {{D|Void}} [[Status Effect]] based on the weapon's total status chance.
***The bullet attractor turns enemy projectiles towards themselves, effectively reflecting damage. This even applies to hit-scan weapons, which cannot exit the bubble.
**The {{D|Void}} damage applies to most weapon hits, including {{M|Acid Shells}} and {{M|Concealed Explosives}}, but not {{M|Bursting Mass}} or {{Weapon|Pathocyst}}'s maggots.
***Since the damage bonus is not applied to the weapon directly, and only activates on-hit, it will not be absorbed into {{M|Bursting Mass}}.
**The Void damage bonus does '''not''' allow Xaku's weapons to damage Eidolon [[Shields]] of the {{E|Eidolon Teralyst}}, {{E|Eidolon Gantulyst}} and {{E|Eidolon Hydrolyst}}, nor the ghostly energy form of the {{E|Eidolon Vomvalyst}}, nor the {{E|Thrax Centurion}} or {{E|Thrax Legatus}} enemies from the [[Zariman Ten Zero]].
**Damage is affected by {{E|Ancient Disruptor}} auras and other enemies that reduce ability damage, unlike other weapon buffing skills.
*On cast, Xaku's right shoulder and arm pieces visually detach then return to position. While active, Infested grey matter envelops their entire body as the Void veins pulse and glow with energy, while surrounded by a Void energy cloud near the torso.
|helminth =
