**When placed on {{WF|Chroma}}, {{WF|Cyte-09}}, {{WF|Mirage}}, {{WF|Octavia}}, {{WF|Oraxia}}, {{WF|Rhino}}, {{WF|Temple}}, and {{WF|Uriel}}, Subsumed Xata's Whisper can only replace {{A|Vex Armor}}, {{A|Resupply}}, {{A|Eclipse}}, {{A|Amp}}, {{A|Silken Stride}}, {{A|Roar}}, {{A|Ripper's Wail}}, and {{A|Demonium}} respectively.
| synergies =
**{{A|Grasp of Lohk}} Void replicas and {{A|The Lost}}'s sub-abilities do '''not''' benefit from the additional {{D|Void}} damage bonus of Xata's Whisper.
**{{A|The Vast Untime}} renders enemies <u>'''50%'''</u> more vulnerable to {{D|Void}} damage and pauses Xata's Whisper's duration timer while active.
*Can be recast while active to refresh the duration.
*Casting Xata's Whisper is an upper-body animation that allows movement while restricting other actions.
